<%= I18n.t('everything_is_an_environment_variable') %>

## <%= I18n.t('general') %>

| <%= I18n.t('variable') %> | <%= I18n.t('default') %> | <%= I18n.t('what_it_does') %> |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `SECRET_KEY_BASE` | — | <%= I18n.t('the_only_variable_that_is_required_in_production_html', generate: '`openssl rand -hex 64`') %> |
| `DATABASE_URL` | `sqlite3:storage/production.sqlite3` | <%= I18n.t('where_spaces_and_task_structure_live_html', postgres: '`postgresql://…`') %> |
| `FORCE_SSL` | `false` | <%= I18n.t('set_true_when_something_in_front_terminates_tls_html', value: '`true`', assume: '`assume_ssl`') %> |
| `PORT` | `3000` | <%= I18n.t('the_port_puma_binds_inside_the_container_html', compose: '`docker-compose.yml`') %> |
| `RAILS_LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | <%= I18n.t('logs_go_to_stdout_and_nowhere_else_this_is_how_much_of_them') %> |
| `RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR` | — | <%= I18n.t('how_many_spaces_and_tasks_one_address_may_create_per_hour') %> |

<%= I18n.t('behind_a_proxy_the_limit_is_only_as_good_as_the_address_html', limit: '`RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR`', forwarded: '`X-Forwarded-For`') %>

## Redis

<%= I18n.t('redis_holds_two_unrelated_things') %>

| <%= I18n.t('variable') %> | <%= I18n.t('default') %> | <%= I18n.t('what_it_does') %> |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `REDIS_URL` | `redis://localhost:6379` | <%= I18n.t('the_server_used_for_both_roles_split_into_db_0_and_db_1') %> |
| `PROGRESS_REDIS_URL` | `REDIS_URL`, db 0 | <%= I18n.t('overrides_the_progress_store_alone') %> |
| `SIDEKIQ_REDIS_URL` | `REDIS_URL`, db 1 | <%= I18n.t('overrides_the_queue_alone') %> |
| `PROGRESS_TTL_SECONDS` | `86400` | <%= I18n.t('how_long_a_task_keeps_its_progress_without_being_written_to') %> |
| `PROGRESS_KEY_PREFIX` | `pw:progress` | <%= I18n.t('key_prefix_for_the_progress_store') %> |

## <%= I18n.t('notifications') %>

<%= I18n.t('both_keys_unset_means_the_feature_does_not_exist_no_button_on_a_space') %>

| <%= I18n.t('variable') %> | <%= I18n.t('default') %> | <%= I18n.t('what_it_does') %> |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY` | — | <%= I18n.t('public_half_of_the_pair_that_signs_every_push') %> |
| `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY` | — | <%= I18n.t('private_half_never_leaves_the_server') %> |
| `VAPID_SUBJECT` | `mailto:hello@progress.watch` | <%= I18n.t('a_contact_address_the_push_services_can_reach') %> |
| `PUSH_CONTENT` | `full` | <%= I18n.t('full_puts_the_task_title_in_the_notification_html', full: '`full`', minimal: '`minimal`') %> |

## <%= I18n.t('process_sizing') %>

| <%= I18n.t('variable') %> | <%= I18n.t('default') %> | <%= I18n.t('what_it_does') %> |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `RAILS_MAX_THREADS` | `5` | <%= I18n.t('puma_threads_per_process_and_the_size_of_both_pools') %> |
| `WEB_CONCURRENCY` | `0` | <%= I18n.t('puma_worker_processes_zero_runs_a_single_process') %> |
| `SIDEKIQ_CONCURRENCY` | `5` | <%= I18n.t('threads_in_the_sidekiq_process') %> |
